'''Eagle rays''' are a monster which can be found in the [[Shrouded Ocean]], [[Unquiet Ocean]], and [[Sunset Ocean]]. They may assigned as a [[bounty task]] starting at level 30 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from the [[Ruins of Unkah]]. They drop [[ray barbs]] which can be used to make [[trawling net]]s.

When hunting the rays, it is beneficial to bring a [[herb sack]] and a [[seed box]], as they frequently drop [[herb]]s and [[seeds]].

Any boat with a [[steel keel]] or better will not take any damage from eagle rays.

